{"ref":"BDB, פֹּ֫עַל","hw":"פֹּ֫עַל","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">פֹּ֫עַל</span></big><sub>37</sub>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.11\">Pr 20:11</a> <strong>doing, deed, work</strong> (poet. and late, nearly = <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲשֶׂה</span>);—<span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:1\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.1\">Hb 1:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:2\" href=\"/Psalms.44.2\">ψ 44:2</a>, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.11\">Dt 33:11</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּעֳלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.4\">32:4</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">פֹּעֲלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.31\">Is 1:31</a> (Kö<sup>ii. 1, 35, 493</sup> Ges<sup>§ 93 q</sup>, v. infr.), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.13\">Je 22:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּעָלְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.24\">Is 41:24</a>, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּעָלִים</span>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.20\">2 S 23:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.22\">1 Ch 11:22</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>deed, thing done:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  of God, <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּעֳלוֹ</span> his work in providence <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.4\">Dt 32:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.12\">Is 5:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 36:24\" href=\"/Job.36.24\">Jb 36:24</a>; in deliverance <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:2\" href=\"/Psalms.44.2\">ψ 44:2</a> (as acc. cogn.), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:13\" href=\"/Psalms.77.13\">77:13</a> + 5 times; in judgment <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:10\" href=\"/Psalms.64.10\">64:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 95:9\" href=\"/Psalms.95.9\">95:9</a>, as acc. cogn. <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:5\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.5\">Hb 1:5</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  of false gods <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.24\">Is 41:24</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  of men, daily toil <a data-ref=\"Job 24:5\" href=\"/Job.24.5\">Jb 24:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:23\" href=\"/Psalms.104.23\">ψ 104:23</a>; specif. act <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:12\" href=\"/Ruth.2.12\">Ru 2:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ יָדָיו</span> of sacrificing <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.11\">Dt 33:11</a>; pl. of <em>achievements</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.20\">2 S 23:20</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.32\">1 Ch 11:32</a>; action as having moral quality <a data-ref=\"Job 34:11\" href=\"/Job.34.11\">Jb 34:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.11\">Pr 20:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.12\">24:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.29\">29</a>, evil implied <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.14\">Je 25:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.29\">50:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 36:9\" href=\"/Job.36.9\">Jb 36:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:4\" href=\"/Psalms.28.4\">ψ 28:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ כַּפָּיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:17\" href=\"/Psalms.9.17\">9:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ חָמָס</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.6\">Is 59:6</a>; good action <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.8\">Pr 21:8</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>work, thing made:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  by hands of God <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.9\">Is 45:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.11\">11</a> (of men). <strong>b.</strong>  by man <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.31\">Is 1:31</a> (i.e. prob. his idol Ges Che<sup>Comm.</sup> Di al.; > read <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעֲלוֹ</span> Lag<sup>Sem. 1:5</sup> Sta<sup>ZAW iii (1883), 12 f.</sup>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>wages of work</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.13\">Je 22:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 7:2\" href=\"/Job.7.2\">Jb 7:2</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <em>acquisition</em> of treasures <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.6\">Pr 21:6</a>.","next":"BDB, פְּעֻלָּה","prev":"BDB, פָּעַל"}